blocks.text:
- one canonical checkpoint history deterministically materializes `mas-artifact`, `mas-memory`, `mas-memory-chain`, and `mas-proofpress-lineage`;
- public task resources hash identically before and after every receiver;
- the multi-agent arm prompts have no arm name or treatment disclosure;
- visible handoff token budgets are within 5%;
- every receiver is a fresh process/session;
- each workflow run uses the same exact model and `high` effort at all five roles;
- OpenRouter cannot silently use `auto`, a latest alias, a fallback provider, or an unresolved model;
- Proofpress capsules pass import/verify and tampering is recorded as invalid;
- the official scorer receives an arm-blind final artifact;
- resume never overwrites a completed run or hides a failed attempt.
